    {
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 12880,
      "text": "Activity 2. Listen again and complete the poster. Then write F, FACT or O, OPINION in"
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 12880,
      "end_ms": 13580,
      "text": "the boxes."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 15360,
      "end_ms": 24560,
      "text": "Welcome to news today. Christmas is coming. It brings joy but also waste and pollution."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 24560,
      "end_ms": 36060,
      "text": "Each year, for example, people in the UK use about 365,000 kilometres of paper for gifts."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 36980,
      "end_ms": 41360,
      "text": "Around the world, people throw away millions of turkeys."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 42800,
      "end_ms": 51000,
      "text": "What's more, people cut down nearly 120 million trees to use as Christmas trees."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 51000,
      "end_ms": 56260,
      "text": "But after Christmas, they often throw the trees away."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 57360,
      "end_ms": 63840,
      "text": "Some families are buying plastic Christmas trees, but they can cause pollution too."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 65120,
      "end_ms": 68000,
      "text": "We should think about new ways of celebrating."
    },
    {
      "start_ms": 69300,
      "end_ms": 72220,
      "text": "Let's have a green Christmas this year."
    }
  ],
